  "step_3": "The decision reason requires the individual to consider the sum of all pairwise differences of outcomes between the lotteries and to prefer the one with the more favorable (larger) sum. In this case, the sum of pairwise differences is equal for both lotteries (1000), so the reason would be indifferent. However, the individual does not mention any calculation or consideration of outcome differences or their sum. Instead, the individual focuses solely on the possibility of avoiding a loss, which is a different rationale. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason involving the sum of pairwise outcome differences. The justification in the report is inconsistent with the rule of the decision reason. Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
